            "heading_size": "h0"
          }
        },
        "text_GgME6E": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We source pure nectar from specific blossoms—so each flavour (lychee, mustard, fennel, sesame, dry-fruit infusions, Himalayan multi-flora) gets its unique character.</p><p>Natural processing, from hive to jar: We never overheat or over-filter, preserving aroma, color, enzymes, and floral notes.</p><p>Harvest only when fully capped: That ensures moisture is low, flavour is full, and your honey stays fresh and stable.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        },
